From: William Emerison Six <billsix@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 22:05:51 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1261/3799] soh: rename func_808E0254 ->
 BossGanon_DrawMaskTexPattern

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence GUESS) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: stamps one shape into the caller's texture buffer using a set of local row-width tables, with the caller's float selecting how far through the pattern to draw; it is called from a loop that steps that value in fifths. What the resulting mask is used for is not visible from here.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Boss_Ganon/z_boss_ganon.c.

Tagged [LLM:GUESS] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Boss_Ganon/z_boss_ganon.c | 5 +++--
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Boss_Ganon/z_boss_ganon.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Boss_Ganon/z_boss_ganon.c
index 28e3365a7..d1d367571 100644
--- a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Boss_Ganon/z_boss_ganon.c
+++ b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Boss_Ganon/z_boss_ganon.c
@@ -3689,7 +3689,8 @@ void BossGanon_DrawDarkVortex(BossGanon* this, PlayState* play) {
     }
 }
 
-void func_808E0254(BossGanon* this, u8* tex, f32 arg2) {
+// LLM generated name (GUESS), was func_808E0254: stamps one shape into the caller's texture buffer using a set of local row-width tables, with the caller's float selecting how far through the pattern to draw; it is called from a loop that steps that value in fifths. What the resulting mask is used for is not visible from here.
+void BossGanon_DrawMaskTexPattern(BossGanon* this, u8* tex, f32 arg2) {
     static s16 D_808E4DF4[] = { 1, 2, 3, 3, 2, 1 };
     static s16 D_808E4E00[] = { 2, 3, 4, 4, 4, 3, 2 };
     static s16 D_808E4E10[] = { 2, 3, 4, 4, 4, 4, 3, 2 };
@@ -3794,7 +3795,7 @@ void BossGanon_GenShadowTexture(u8* tex, BossGanon* this, PlayState* play) {
     Matrix_RotateX(1.0f, MTXMODE_NEW);
 
     for (i = 0; i <= 5; i++) {
-        func_808E0254(this, tex, i / 5.0f);
+        BossGanon_DrawMaskTexPattern(this, tex, i / 5.0f);  // was func_808E0254 [LLM:GUESS]
     }
 
     for (i = 0; i < 12; i++) {
